	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Usage

Search Discogs releases, artists, labels and masters via the `dc` keyword.

Type `dc` and a query to search the Discogs database as you type.

![Discogs search results in Alfred](images/about/main.png)

* `dc &lt;query&gt;` - search releases, artists, labels and masters as you type.
* &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; or &lt;kbd&gt;⇥&lt;/kbd&gt; on an artist, label or master - its releases; on a release - its tracklist.
* The path builds up in the search box (`dc Aphex Twin &gt; Drukqs`); delete the last part to go back.
* The first row of a page is the page itself: &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; opens it in the browser, &lt;kbd&gt;⇥&lt;/kbd&gt; goes back.
* Type after a path to filter that page.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌥&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; - open the item's Discogs page.

### Maintenance

* `:dc` - cache size (&lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; reveals the folder) and Empty Cache.

## Workflow Configuration

Set the Discogs API token in the [Workflow's Configuration](https://www.alfredapp.com/help/workflows/user-configuration/).
</string>
